rem Powerful Digit Counts
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=63
rem Count integers with N digits that
rem are also an Nth power

use sequences
use io
use cli

rem Largest power, 22 is enough for 9.
option Top integer = 25

Pows' = 1 to Top
Grid' = (1 to 9) Pows outer **
Size' = Grid text rank 0 len rank 0
Answer = Size equal Pows count
Answer print
